{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium image card carousel block with exactly 3 cards.
    Each card must contain, in this exact order from top to bottom:
    
    1. A full-width image that fills the card edge-to-edge with no white space
       or padding around it. The image must have border-radius ONLY on the
       top-left and top-right corners matching the card border-radius exactly,
       and border-radius: 0 on the bottom corners, so it blends seamlessly
       with no gap or white line. The image must use object-fit: cover and
       object-position: center so it always fills its container without
       distortion or empty space.
       Settings: image picker per card.
       Image height: fixed 200px on desktop, 180px on mobile.
       The image container must have width: 100%, height: 200px,
       overflow: hidden, flex-shrink: 0.
    
    2. A heading below the image.
       Settings: text input, font picker (default Aleo), 
       font size (range 16–40px, default 20px),
       font weight (Normal / Medium / Bold, default Bold),
       text color picker (default #000000),
       text alignment (Left / Center / Right, default Left),
       padding-top (range 8–32px, default 12px),
       padding-sides (range 8–32px, default 14px).
    
    3. A body text paragraph below the heading.
       Settings: textarea input, font picker (default System UI),
       font size (range 12–20px, default 13px),
       text color picker (default #666666),
       text alignment (Left / Center / Right, default Left),
       padding-top (range 4–24px, default 6px),
       padding-sides (range 8–32px, default 14px),
       line-height (range 1.2–2.0, default 1.5).
    
    4. A pill-shaped CTA button inside the card.
       Settings: button label text input, external URL input (opens in new tab),
       font picker (default Andada Pro), font size (range 12–18px, default 13px),
       background color picker (default #dedede),
       text color picker (default #000000),
       hover background color picker (default #dedede),
       hover text color picker (default #aa7d44),
       border radius (range 0–50px, default 50px),
       border width (range 0–4px), border color picker,
       button width (Auto / Full width, default Auto),
       padding-vertical (range 6–20px, default 9px),
       padding-horizontal (range 14–40px, default 20px),
       margin-top (range 8–28px, default 12px),
       margin-sides (range 8–32px, default 14px),
       margin-bottom (range 8–32px, default 16px).
    
    5. A secondary plain text link below the button, still inside the card.
       Settings: link label text input, URL input (opens in new tab),
       font size (range 12–16px, default 12px),
       text color picker (default #aa7d44), underline toggle (default On),
       margin-top (range 4–20px, default 6px),
       margin-bottom (range 8–28px, default 14px),
       text alignment (Left / Center / Right, default Left),
       padding-sides (range 8–32px, default 14px).
    
    Card design settings:
    - Card background color picker (default #ffffff)
    - Card border radius (range 0–50px, default 50px)
    - Card border width (range 0–4px) and border color picker
    - overflow: hidden on the card element so the image clips correctly
      to the rounded top corners with NO white line or gap
    - DO NOT add any border, outline, or inner margin that could create
      a white line between the image and the card border
    - The card must use display: flex, flex-direction: column so content
      stacks vertically and the card height is determined by its content,
      NOT by a fixed height — this keeps cards compact and not excessively tall
    - Premium floating shadow on the card WRAPPER (a div OUTSIDE the card),
      NOT on the card itself, so the shadow is NEVER clipped:
      default: box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.16), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.09)
    - Shadow intensity selector (None / Subtle / Medium / Strong / Ultra)
    - Shadow color picker (default #000000)
    - Card wrapper must have padding: 10px and background: transparent
      so the shadow renders freely without any white margin cutting it off
    
    Carousel & layout settings:
    - DESKTOP: show exactly 2 full cards side by side, with a visible peek
      of the third card (approximately 30px visible on the right edge).
      Achieve this by setting each card width to:
      calc((100% - gap - peek) / 2) where gap = 20px and peek = 30px.
      Formula: card width = calc(50% - 25px) on desktop.
    - MOBILE: show exactly 1 full card with a visible peek of the second
      card (approximately 24px visible on the right edge).
      Card width on mobile: calc(100% - 44px).
    - Gap between cards: 20px (range 8–48px)
    - Carousel container horizontal padding: 16px left and right so the
      peeking card edge and card shadows are never clipped
    - The carousel track must use display: flex, flex-wrap: nowrap,
      align-items: stretch
    - overflow: visible on Y axis, overflow-x: scroll on the container
      so vertical shadows are NEVER clipped
    - scroll-snap-type: x mandatory on the container
    - scroll-snap-align: start on each card wrapper
    - scroll-behavior: smooth
    - Hide scrollbar (scrollbar-width: none, -webkit-scrollbar: none)
    - Navigation arrows toggle (Show / Hide, default Show)
    - Arrow position (Outside cards, defau
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 16px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .ai-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: scroll;
    overflow-y: visible;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 10px;
    background: transparent;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc(50% - 25px);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: calc(100% - 44px);
    }
  }

  .ai-card-shadow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    {% if block.settings.shadow_intensity == 'none' %}
      box-shadow: none;
    {% elsif block.settings.shadow_intensity == 'subtle' %}
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.08 }}, 0 1px 4px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.05 }};
    {% elsif block.settings.shadow_intensity == 'medium' %}
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.12 }}, 0 2px 8px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.07 }};
    {% elsif block.settings.shadow_intensity == 'strong' %}
      box-shadow: 0 16px 48px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.16 }}, 0 4px 16px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.09 }};
    {% elsif block.settings.shadow_intensity == 'ultra' %}
      box-shadow: 0 24px 64px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.2 }}, 0 8px 24px {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.12 }};
    {% endif %}
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    {% if block.settings.card_border_width > 0 %}
      border: {{ block.settings.card_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px 0 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 200px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 180px;
    }
  }

  .ai-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-card-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.heading_padding_top }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.heading_padding_sides }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.heading_padding_sides }}px;
    margin: 0;
    {% if block.settings.heading_font_weight == 'normal' %}
      font-weight: 400;
    {% elsif block.settings.heading_font_weight == 'medium' %}
      font-weight: 500;
    {% elsif block.settings.heading_font_weight == 'bold' %}
      font-weight: 700;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-card-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.body_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.body_alignment }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.body_line_height }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.body_padding_top }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.body_padding_sides }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.body_padding_sides }}px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_margin_top }}px;
    margin-left: {{ block.settings.button_margin_sides }}px;
    margin-right: {{ block.settings.button_margin_sides }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.button_margin_bottom }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    {% if block.settings.button_border_width > 0 %}
      border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    {% else %}
      border: none;
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.button_width == 'full' %}
      width: calc(100% - {{ block.settings.button_margin_sides | times: 2 }}px);
      text-align: center;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-card-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.link_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.link_alignment }};
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.link_margin_top }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.link_margin_bottom }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.link_padding_sides }}px;
    padding-right: {{ block.settings.link_padding_sides }}px;
    {% if block.settings.link_underline %}
      text-decoration: underline;
    {% else %}
      text-decoration: none;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-card-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: {{ block.settings.link_color }};
    {% if block.settings.link_underline %}
      text-decoration: underline;
    {% else %}
      text-decoration: none;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-nav-arrows-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-nav-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-nav-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_bg_color }};
  }

  .ai-nav-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }
{% endstyle %}

<premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-carousel-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..3) %}
      {% liquid
        assign image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_image'
        assign heading_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_heading'
        assign body_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_body'
        assign button_label_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_button_label'
        assign button_url_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_button_url'
        assign link_label_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link_label'
        assign link_url_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_link_url'

        assign card_image = block.settings[image_key]
        assign card_heading = block.settings[heading_key]
        assign card_body = block.settings[body_key]
        assign card_button_label = block.settings[button_label_key]
        assign card_button_url = block.settings[button_url_key]
        assign card_link_label = block.settings[link_label_key]
        assign card_link_url = block.settings[link_url_key]
      %}

      <div class="ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-card-shadow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-card-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if card_image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ card_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="600"
                  height="200"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-card-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if card_heading != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-card-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_heading }}</h3>
            {% endif %}

            {% if card_body != blank %}
              <p class="ai-card-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_body }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if card_button_label != blank %}
              <a
                href="{{ card_button_url }}"
                class="ai-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                {{ card_button_label }}
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if card_link_label != blank %}
              <div class="ai-card-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <a href="{{ card_link_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  {{ card_link_label }}
                </a>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.show_arrows %}
    <div class="ai-nav-arrows-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <button class="ai-nav-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-nav-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Previous">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <button class="ai-nav-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-nav-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Next">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PremiumCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.track = this.querySelector('.ai-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.prevButton = this.querySelector('.ai-nav-prev-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        this.nextButton = this.querySelector('.ai-nav-next-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

        if (this.prevButton && this.nextButton) {
          this.prevButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.scrollPrev());
          this.nextButton.addEventListener('click', () => this.scrollNext());
        }
      }

      scrollPrev() {
        const cardWidth = this.track.querySelector('.ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}').offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_gap }};
        this.track.scrollBy({
          left: -(cardWidth + gap),
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });
      }

      scrollNext() {
        const cardWidth = this.track.querySelector('.ai-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}').offsetWidth;
        const gap = {{ block.settings.card_gap }};
        this.track.scrollBy({
          left: cardWidth + gap,
          behavior: 'smooth'
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('premium-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PremiumCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

